{"name": "The Apprentice", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's your final exam. Your master sends you through a portal to an unknown world. You cross the magical door and find yourself with a staff in hand and a mission: find the necessary runes to reactivate the portal and return home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551120/extras/bdaa83c7054f8df5856d3dc526306db2.poster.avif?t=1784125486\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551120/extras/bdaa83c7054f8df5856d3dc526306db2.webm?t=1784125486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551120/extras/bdaa83c7054f8df5856d3dc526306db2.mp4?t=1784125486\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this alien world, your only tool is ingenuity. Investigate the fauna, explore every corner and experiment with the runes you discover. It's not just about learning new powers, but understanding them, combining them and discovering uses never before seen.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>MASTER THE MAGIC OF RUNES</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover new runes as you progress through your adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine how you use runes to create unique effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The order of your actions matters: experiment with different sequences</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551120/extras/d6f4f15d6516c0a18b02d98bced5cc6a.poster.avif?t=1784125486\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551120/extras/d6f4f15d6516c0a18b02d98bced5cc6a.webm?t=1784125486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551120/extras/d6f4f15d6516c0a18b02d98bced5cc6a.mp4?t=1784125486\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>SOLVE INCREASINGLY COMPLEX PUZZLES</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each obstacle requires a specific combination of spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn to read the environment: visual details will guide you toward the solution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no single correct path: experiment freely</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551120/extras/fc2420bbff90560eeba6f9b4359b13d2.poster.avif?t=1784125486\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551120/extras/fc2420bbff90560eeba6f9b4359b13d2.webm?t=1784125486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551120/extras/fc2420bbff90560eeba6f9b4359b13d2.mp4?t=1784125486\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>INNOVATIVE STRATEGIC COMBAT</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your spells cleverly and strategically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat enemies by thinking, not aiming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn patterns, anticipate movements and design your strategy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551120/extras/6585ee94c7c86ab93e9d22a37ce05365.poster.avif?t=1784125486\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551120/extras/6585ee94c7c86ab93e9d22a37ce05365.webm?t=1784125486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551120/extras/6585ee94c7c86ab93e9d22a37ce05365.mp4?t=1784125486\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>EXPLORE AN UNKNOWN WORLD</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interconnected world with multiple routes and secrets to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic camera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each zone presents new environmental challenges and enemies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551120/extras/77e646a5077231db860ad64e9139c977.poster.avif?t=1784125486\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551120/extras/77e646a5077231db860ad64e9139c977.webm?t=1784125486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551120/extras/77e646a5077231db860ad64e9139c977.mp4?t=1784125486\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your journey home begins here. Learning to master the runes will not only allow you to reactivate the portal, but also turn you into the mage you've always wanted to 